msgctxt "64"
msgid "Welcome. What can I get for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Oh, no, I don't need anything. I'm here to talk to you about\r\n"
"your son."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "My son? You know my son, Tsutomu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I do. Truth is, something crazy happened to him in\r\n"
"Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Something crazy!? Is Tsutomu alright!? What happened!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "He's fine. Some people would think this is good news, actually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "...He won the Shonen Five grand prize?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"I know you might not think it's a great accomplishment,\r\n"
"but in the manga world, this is a really big deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "I don't know that much about manga, but I do know this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"There are hundreds of thousands of people aspiring to become\r\n"
"professional manga artists. It's incredible that your son and\r\n"
"his manga were chosen, out of the many hopefuls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Hell, even the kids I'm looking after read Shonen Five.\r\n"
"One of them wanted to read it so badly, he asked me to pick\r\n"
"up his copy while I was in Tokyo so he could read it early."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Despite that, your son is trying to throw away his dream\r\n"
"of becoming a manga artist because of what you might think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"There's nothing wrong with wanting to be a doctor, but his\r\n"
"dream of becoming a manga artist is just as good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "...It's my fault. I put so much pressure on him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "You wanted him to be a doctor, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"That's right. For generations, every member of our family\r\n"
"has followed a career in medicine, whether that meant\r\n"
"being pharmacists, nurses, or medical researchers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Despite that... not one of us has ever become a doctor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"So that's why you were hoping your son would become\r\n"
"a doctor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Tsutomu had the grades and the potential to become a doctor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"I made sure he wasn't distracted by anything silly when he\r\n"
"was young. He needed to focus on his studies, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "And manga was one of those silly things?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"That's right. Tsutomu always loved to read manga. Truth\r\n"
"be told, I bought him lots of manga when he was a child."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"But as soon as he started junior high, I made him throw away\r\n"
"his entire collection. He had hundreds of manga volumes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "And you made him throw every last one in the garbage?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Not the garbage... I made him throw them into the Kubochi\r\n"
"River."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"I thought that doing so would make him hate manga and focus\r\n"
"more on his studies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "No surprise he's reacting the way he is now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"If Tsutomu really is going to throw away this amazing\r\n"
"opportunity... then it's all my fault."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "I can see where you're coming from."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Any father would want their son to fulfill the dreams\r\n"
"he couldn't fulfill himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "It's not like that! My lifelong dream was... It was..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Huh? You okay? What was your dream?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "It's nothing. My dream doesn't matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"If Tsutomu wants to follow his dream of becoming a manga artist\r\n"
"then I don't want him to give it up for nothing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "If he's got a dream... I want him to chase after it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "...You might be able to make it in time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"I think he's here in Okinawa. Someone saw a guy carrying\r\n"
"that huge backpack of his."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "A backpack?"
msgstr "Uno zaino?"

msgctxt "604"
msgid "I thought of something while we were talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"I think he's going to use the same method you made him use when he had to "
"throw away all his manga: he's going to toss his dreams in the river."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "No... in the Kubochi River?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "More than likely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"What am I standing around here for, then!? I've got to find\r\n"
"Tsutomu!"
msgstr ""

